      "description": "<p>Researcher Nathan Cofnas previously claimed Black people would hold few high-profile positions in a meritocracy</p><p>Nathan Cofnas, the academic who made plagiarism allegations against Prof Jason Arday before his death, has been suspended by a university.</p><p>Arday, 41, resigned from his role at the University of Cambridge this month after coverage of Cofnas’s accusations of plagiarism. The allegations, which were not proven in any formal investigation, triggered questions about Arday’s achievements.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/20/academic-who-accused-jason-arday-of-plagiarism-suspended-by-his-university\">Continue reading...</a>",
